          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha muyaayi wi Ahija we hiiri ya Isaka, yaazira Nadabu hasi ma naamwita lwa Nadabu ni liihi lilie vaali nivakumbiriza lidaala linene lia Gibezoni mu Filisitia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaga gekoleka mu ing'inga yu muhiga gwa kavaga gwu vwamihi vwu mwami Asa wi Ivuyuda. Nandio Baasha yavugula vogono vwa Nadabu kuli mwami wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonoho, yaatanga kwita vandu vinyumba vosi va Jeroboamu. Lilondekana na ga Yahova yaali navooye kuvitira mu mutumikiri weve, muporofeti Ahija kutura Shilo, vandu vinyumba va Jeroboamu vosi viitwa; sihaali ho nu mulala watigala mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaga gekoleka kigira Jeroboamu yavuukiza vutima vwa Yahova, Nyasaye wa Isiraeli, kigira vwoni vwa yakola kandi yaakolo Isiraeli kokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
